<title>USA: Port condition update - Savannah - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port condition update - Savannah - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>Savannah, Georgia, Sept 4 - Due to the approach of hurricane Fran, Savannah port will close at 1500 local today. All vessels currently docked will leave port for anchorage until the storm passes.</p>
</text>
